{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-37","kind":"proposition","title":"同底同高三角形面积相等","englishTitle":"Triangles which are on the same base and in the same parallels are equal to one another.","book":1,"number":37,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.37","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.37/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":37,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-37@raw-3532456f805b2876","contentId":"euclid-1-37","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3532456f805b2876d08961caf071a5d70499a066478ff65351ed79acd3b7eb0b","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-37.statement","euclid-1-37.construction.1","euclid-1-37.construction.2","euclid-1-37.proof.1","euclid-1-37.proof.2","euclid-1-37.proof.3","euclid-1-37.proof.4","euclid-1-37.proof.5","euclid-1-37.proof.6","euclid-1-37.proof.7","euclid-1-37.conclusion","euclid-1-37.historical.1","euclid-1-37.historical.2","euclid-1-37.historical.3","euclid-1-37.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-37.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-37","revisionId":"euclid-1-37@raw-3532456f805b2876","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f4e90383a91afafd0e3d8b3c6a42298ac5aa7a57738fb5ab9afe720ff1205ec9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Triangles which are on the same base and in the same parallels are equal to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同一底边和同一平行的三角形是等同的。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两平行线内有两三角形若同底则两形必等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果在两条平行线上有两个三角形，并且它们有相同的底边，那么这两个图形必须相等"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-37.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-37","revisionId":"euclid-1-37@raw-3532456f805b2876","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"279b0a1e858f3d0c9f19d7fa9060a0e7d07a4c17f75cd3b3ec04ee0827797a80","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABC, DBC be triangles on the same base BC and in the same parallels AD, BC; I say that the triangle ABC is equal to the triangle DBC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABC,DBC成为同一底边,BC的三角形,并同时AD,BC;我说,三角ABC等于三角DBC。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-37.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-1-37","revisionId":"euclid-1-37@raw-3532456f805b2876","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"849098ff6c3b69f895e34ec754a01da353d0a17e022b70e2798a4e556ed51f07","citations":["euclid-1-31"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AD be produced in both directions to E, F; through B let BE be drawn parallel to CA, [[I. 31](/principles/euclid-1-31)] and through C let CF be drawn parallel to BD. [[I. 31](/principles/euclid-1-31)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将AD扩大到E,F;将B扩大到CA,将BE扩大到BE,将C扩大到CF,将BD扩大到CF。 [[I. 31](/principles/euclid-1-31)] [[I. 31](/principles/euclid-1-31)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-37.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-37","revisionId":"euclid-1-37@raw-3532456f805b2876","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a1f3657c111543ea1df35ea9267829743bcc3af16fe88575cdb4e7014abbc932","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then each of the figures EBCA, DBCF is a parallelogram; and they are equal,"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"EBCA,DBCF数字中,每张数字都是平行四边形,它们都是相等的,"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-37.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-37","revisionId":"euclid-1-37@raw-3532456f805b2876","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"04e97dddf2419b8a5f48aa0b051a4268ad2b0d7cc007040fe8410b719d5b22fc","citations":["euclid-1-35"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"for they are on the same base BC and in the same parallels BC, EF. [[I. 35](/principles/euclid-1-35)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为两者的距离是底边 BC, 平行是BC, EF。 [[I. 35](/principles/euclid-1-35)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-37.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-1-37","revisionId":"euclid-1-37@raw-3532456f805b2876","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b571de9c8a9796f1e1042ad0e7475152a407ed37ec7ce177e46fbc155b41309e","citations":["euclid-1-34"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Moreover the triangle ABC is half of the parallelogram EBCA; for the diameter AB bisects it. [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"此外,三角形ABC是平行四边形 EBCA的一半;对角线为AB两部分。 [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-37.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-1-37","revisionId":"euclid-1-37@raw-3532456f805b2876","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fd4df009228fdc6ac952089d337906a41d6f57ab888b527c8c26362077bc4e7f","citations":["euclid-1-34"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the triangle DBC is half of the parallelogram DBCF; for the diameter DC bisects it. [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"三角形DBC是平行四边形 DBCF的一半,对角线DC的两部分是它。 [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-37.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-1-37","revisionId":"euclid-1-37@raw-3532456f805b2876","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"67f66e71a66e9ce526d9890cd72e1ae85146fc3c2f02174bda5188330a826a96","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"[But the halves of equal things are equal to one another.]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"万物的分界线,是相等的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-37.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-1-37","revisionId":"euclid-1-37@raw-3532456f805b2876","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5c4d928ffd71634802e807fefeb6f9c13530a7e65e9cac4f46ae95ba7233332f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the triangle ABC is equal to the triangle DBC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此三角形ABC等于三角形DBC。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-37.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-1-37","revisionId":"euclid-1-37@raw-3532456f805b2876","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0def46992eb0b105b82d6bce6477450c524a884c436026a0e1ed896becf6c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-37.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-1-37","revisionId":"euclid-1-37@raw-3532456f805b2876","order":10,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a767bacf26447ac75c1864eb85eb90c16406ee2f0184be6b8ee076c3e1a38d5c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-37.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-37","revisionId":"euclid-1-37@raw-3532456f805b2876","order":11,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"84315cd0cbd29b24656f7b1e8a1179969230e8f699ded1bb5e134f7aa3d4a238","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两平行线内有两三角形若同底则两形必等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果在两条平行线上有两个三角形，并且它们有相同的底边，那么这两个图形必须相等"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-37.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-1-37","revisionId":"euclid-1-37@raw-3532456f805b2876","order":12,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9186a1bd24fe5d73f1a3e5cba31f463bd56233ffcfcb0d9bc88a5cf9531268d9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"解曰：甲乙丙丁两平行线内有甲丙丁乙丙丁两角形同丙丁底题言两形必等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"解释如下：在两条平行线 :甲乙丙丁 内，有两个三角形 甲丙丁乙丙丁，它们的底边与 丙丁 相同。命题：这两个图形必须相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-37.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-1-37","revisionId":"euclid-1-37@raw-3532456f805b2876","order":13,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fdee47b7ca6c3e0bbde75d6fb0a3a07e5e511d801523a14586a308827440fb79","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：试自丁至戊作直线与甲丙平行次自丁至己作直线与乙丙平行〈本篇三一〉夫甲丙丁戊乙丙丁己两平行方形在甲乙丙丁两平行线内同丙丁底既等〈本篇三五〉则甲丙丁角形为甲丙丁戊方形之半与乙丙丁角形为乙丙丁己方形之半者〈甲丁乙丁两对角线平分两方形见本篇卅四〉亦等〈公论七〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：从 丁 到 戊 画一条平行于 甲丙 的直线，平行于 甲丙，然后从 丁 到 己 画一条平行于 乙丙 的直线，平行于 〈本篇三一〉 和 甲丙丁戊乙丙丁己。两个平行四边形 甲丙丁戊乙丙丁己 平行于 甲乙丙丁，底边等于 丙丁。如果 〈本篇三五〉 是 甲丙丁 的三角形，那么三角形 甲丙丁 是正方形 甲丙丁戊 的一半，三角形 乙丙丁 是正方形 乙丙丁己 的一半。〈甲丁乙丁两对角线平分两方形见本篇卅四〉 也等于 〈公论七〉。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-37.source","contentId":"euclid-1-37","revisionId":"euclid-1-37@raw-3532456f805b2876","order":14,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"97204a36d258cf6d8162dd272c5714537ce7f42e42976d8b7a0e0c9d6a55bf78","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.37/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.37\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-1-37:euclid-1-31:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-37","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-37.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-31","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.37","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.37/","sourceLabel":"I. 31"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-1-37:euclid-1-35:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-37","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-37.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-35","type":"depends_on","pr